      "source": "from cell import Cell\n\ndef make_grid(rows, width):\n    grid = []\n    gap = width // rows\n\n    for i in range(rows):\n        grid.append([])\n        for j in range(rows):\n            grid[i].append(Cell(i, j, gap))\n\n    return grid\n",
